{
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 formalization of four almost-all descent results for shortcut Collatz orbits in ordinary natural density: a general moving-endpoint first-passage theorem with a quantitative dyadic-shell error profile; the fixed-exponent polylogarithmic specialization with the full explicit entropy-margin exceptional-rate range; a stretched-logarithmic same-witness companion with a 6.953 log n clock and orbit ceiling; and a quantitative stretched-logarithmic exceptional count retaining every strict exponent sigma < 1 - delta.",
